# shell: desktop
# apps: fixture
# AW-047/AW-045: the Open With window is single-selection and list only,
# its buttons live from the selection, Return opens, and Escape cancels.
wait 8
click-row 1
wait 2
press-row 1 3
wait 2
release-row 1 3
wait 5
menu-pick Open with
wait 3
menu-pick Open with…
wait 8
expect-windows 2
note its foot is where a 12 px face puts it
expect-pixel 350 419 336698
note the best claim leads the list; Down takes it and Return opens
key Down
wait 3
note and the row it took is lit where the first row is drawn -- which
note pins WHERE the list puts its rows, not merely that a key was taken
expect-pixel 350 193 336698
key Return
wait 25
expect-file /tmp/trk_launched
expect-windows 1
note asked again, Escape is the whole answer
click-row 1
wait 2
press-row 1 3
wait 2
release-row 1 3
wait 5
menu-pick Open with
wait 3
menu-pick Open with…
wait 8
expect-windows 2
key Escape
wait 5
expect-windows 1
note an application that does not claim the type asks first (AW-046)
remove /tmp/trk_launched
click-row 1
wait 2
press-row 1 3
wait 2
release-row 1 3
wait 5
menu-pick Open with
wait 3
menu-pick Open with…
wait 8
note past the two that claim it stands the one that does not
key Down
wait 2
key Down
wait 2
key Down
wait 2
key Return
wait 5
expect-alert does not claim
key o
wait 25
expect-file /tmp/trk_launched
note now raise the interface to 16 px and ask for this window again:
note its rows and its height were written down for a 12 px face, so this
note is the only size at which a wrong number would show
click 980 20
wait 4
menu-pick Settings
wait 4
menu-pick Fonts
wait 12
expect-title Fonts
key Tab
key Tab
key Return
wait 12
key Return
wait 12
expect-font Sans 16
key w ctrl
wait 8
press-row 1 3
wait 2
release-row 1 3
wait 5
menu-pick Open with
wait 3
menu-pick Open with…
wait 10
expect-title Open with
note and now it reaches past where it used to end: ten rows of application
note names, each one taller than it was
expect-pixel 350 419 d8d8d8
note and the list still begins under the line of text above it, which moved
note down with the face rather than staying at the 26 pixels it was written
expect-pixel 350 183 d8d8d8
quit
